            "review_text": "Helen T\nSeongnam, South Korea11 contributions\n1\nLovely Lebanese restaurant in D7!\nMar 2019 • Family\nI have been eating at Terrace Al Sham for a few months now and I can highly recommend it. The food is delicious, the owner cooks it all to order and you really feel as though you have been welcomed in to somebody's home when you eat here. It's a cosy place and I have brought many friends here and each one was very impressed. Spread the word! Lovely place to eat!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 19, 2019",
